<li><strong>Permits.</strong> The city requires a permit to re-roof, and its submission includes a TDI WPI-1 form. The <a href="https://www.corpuschristitx.gov/department-directory/development-services/construction-codes-and-ordinances/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">City of Corpus Christi</a> adopted the 2021 IRC and IBC with local amendments effective August 1, 2023. See our <a href="/local-building-codes/">local building codes</a> page.</li>
